<h2>Goals</h2>
<ul>
<li>Send a confirmation email when an order is placed, wrapped onto a second line</li>
<li>Keep the <strong>existing</strong> on-screen confirmation<ol>
<li>first nested, <em>ordered</em>
</li>
<li>second nested with <code>code_span</code> and a <a href="https://example.com/a_b-c">link</a>
</li>
</ol>
</li>
</ul>
